# ARGUS — public repository.
#
# What is deliberately IN this repo: all source, the evaluation holdout, the
# training-pipeline scripts, the frozen model-ladder harness, the final report
# (EN + ZH) and the full technical manual.
#
# What stays OUT: build output, local machine state, anything secret, and the
# bulk training imagery (tens of GB, re-downloadable from its sources — see
# datasets/README.md).

# ---- Credentials: never commit ---------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
credentials
aws_credentials*
*_secret*
*secret_access_key*

# ---- Local-only working material -------------------------------------------
_private/
scratchpad/
_claude_state/

# ---- Bulk training imagery --------------------------------------------------
# The holdout and the pipeline scripts ARE tracked. Only the multi-GB source
# and assembled training sets are excluded.
datasets/sources/
datasets/v7_*_worm/
datasets/v8_worm/
datasets/v9_worm/
training-data/

# ---- Build + packaging output ----------------------------------------------
deployer/dist/
deployer/build/
deployer/layer/
deployer/out/
*.exe
*.spec.bak

# ---- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ---- Local / machine specific ----------------------------------------------
.vscode/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
*.bak
*.tmp
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- MS Office owner/lock files ---------------------------------------------
~$*
